   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of PWDs participated in the consultations to unpack challenges in employment and brainstorming sessions on possible solutions</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">A comprehensive review of employment and social protection information and data to assess current situation and estimate the existing gaps and opportunities for the labour market and social protection integration of PWDs. Discussion and interaction with relevant stakeholders to ensure that policy, financing, regulatory, management, administrative and communication recommendations are relevant, well-integrated and have tripartite buy-in. As government provisions lack appropriate data, this stage will allow advocacy of the positive impacts of the inclusion of PWDs in employment and social protection schemes and a better understanding of the barriers to businesses on the employment of PWD and these workers with disabilities in social protection schemes such as SOCSO.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2024"></baseline>
